  "about": "Every VRM-vocabulary name the moving motion headers still spell, and what disposes of it on arrival in usd-motion-plugins. Checked by scripts/check_motion_vocabulary.py (workspace_motion_vocabulary). The line through vrmRetarget and the findings are docs/architecture/WORKSPACE.md §9.5; the renames are its §9.3. SCOPE, 2026-09-21: motionCore and motionRuntime have left, so their rows are gone with the headers that spelled them -- 20 of the original 40 -- and what is left is vrmRetarget's generic half, the one set of headers still moving. This ledger empties when that half leaves, and the check goes with it.",
